Subject: [PATCH] Improvements to the demo
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

* Add support to run the frr container in the host network assuming the
  host is a libvirt hupervisor running the cluster
* Add support for dual stack
* Add support to stablish a second BGP session

Signed-off-by: Jaime Caamaño Ruiz <jcaamano@redhat.com>
---
